tion LLM `score_fn` in `roles/evidence.py` re-running the critic panel over the deepened corpus (every call metered, no CostRecorder bypass); runnable `bin/engine-diff.py` enforcing a GO/NO-GO gate (`agreementâ‰¥0.95`, `min_samplesâ‰¥200`, `unearned==0`, `costâ‰¤1.5Ã—`); promotion switch `AURORA_EVIDENCE_ENGINE` wired but **defaults to legacy**. The live flip is SA-2, not done here.\n\n**llm.py upgrades (Waves 3-8) â€” cost-telemetry substrate first, by design**\n- **Wave 3 (L1):** cost-telemetry substrate **before** any feature emits the new spend â€” migration `0024_costs_cache_batch.sql` adds nullable `cache_read_tokens`/`cache_write_tokens`/`batch_mode` columns; pricing.yaml gets cache sub-rates (~0.1Ã— input read, ~1.25Ã— input write) + `batch_discount: 0.5`. Legacy 4-arg `record()` calls must stay byte-for-byte identical.\n- **Wave 4 (L2):** prompt caching (`cache_control` ephemeral) on high-repetition system+rubric prefixes (critic_a, security judge, reconciler); Sonnetâ†’Haiku fallback carries the same cache_control; metered via Wave 3.\n- **Wave 5 (L3):** structured outputs (`output_schema`) replacing brittle `json.loads(strip_fences(...))` on critic/reconciler/security-judge paths; off-schema judge response still **fails closed to `abstain`**; Gemini/langextract path stays as-is.\n- **Wave 6 (L4):** adaptive thinking via `effort`; a guard that **never sends `budget_tokens`** (deprecated on 4.6+; Opus 4.8 returns 400); folds API-reported thinking tokens into metered output (root cause of the prior $118 incident).\n- **Wave 7 (L5):** retarget default model tags to current tiers (Opus 4.x / Sonnet 4.6 / Haiku 4.5) + add a `tokenizer_factor` (1.0 default, 1.35 for 4.7+) applied **only to pre-call estimates, never to post-call metering** (real `resp.usage` stays ground-truth).\n- **Wave 8 (L6):** opt-in async Message Batches path (`AURORA_BATCH_SWEEP=1`, default off) for nightly sweeps (~50% discount); per-item failure degrades to synchronous and the sweep never aborts; missing security-judge batch result maps to `abstain` (fail-closed).\n\n**Dependency chain**\n- Strictly linear: Wave 1 â†’ 2 â†’ 3 â†’ 4 â†’ 5 â†’ 6 â†’ 7 â†’ 8. Each wave's `done-when` requires `pytest` green and no test weakening; several acceptance criteria are flagged `[SUBTLE]` as regression-test traps (cache pricing, batch 0.5Ã— exactness, no-`budget_tokens`, tokenizer-factor-estimates-only).\n\n**Provenance**\n- Combined from two code-grounded source plans: `docs/AURORA_HARDENING_PLAN.md` (H1-H2) and `docs/AURORA_LLM_UPGRADES_PLAN.md` (L1-L6), each authored by a Plan sub-agent, then ordered for Foreman.\n\nWant me to save this as an Aurora project memory, or is this for inclusion elsewhere?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8486,"cache_read_input_tokens":33941,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8486},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"39042805-5746-43ef-ac9a-4f58d14dc2d4","uuid":"405e6d41-db60-4b40-ac91-4ac91ced502d","request_id":"req_011CcBosj6KFLHxaCVJcXaaH"}
