e degrades to synchronous and the sweep never aborts; missing security-judge batch result maps to `abstain` (fail-closed).\n\n**Dependency chain**\n- Strictly linear: Wave 1 â†’ 2 â†’ 3 â†’ 4 â†’ 5 â†’ 6 â†’ 7 â†’ 8. Each wave's `done-when` requires `pytest` green and no test weakening; several acceptance criteria are flagged `[SUBTLE]` as regression-test traps (cache pricing, batch 0.5Ã— exactness, no-`budget_tokens`, tokenizer-factor-estimates-only).\n\n**Provenance**\n- Combined from two code-grounded source plans: `docs/AURORA_HARDENING_PLAN.md` (H1-H2) and `docs/AURORA_LLM_UPGRADES_PLAN.md` (L1-L6), each authored by a Plan sub-agent, then ordered for Foreman.\n\nWant me to save this as an Aurora project memory, or is this for inclusion elsewhere?","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"39042805-5746-43ef-ac9a-4f58d14dc2d4","total_cost_usd":0.2741955,"usage":{"input_tokens":5069,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14158,"cache_read_input_tokens":90479,"output_tokens":2455,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14158,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":784,"output_tokens":1987,"cache_read_input_tokens":33941,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8486},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":556,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000656,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8[1m]":{"inputTokens":5069,"outputTokens":2455,"cacheReadInputTokens":90479,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14158,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2735395,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"f41422c8-84e2-4192-811c-353a8bbeac0b"}
